# TNA HW catalogue — Englishify pipeline.
# This file replaces ~390 lines of Python (run_tna_btut_then_tcd.py).

seed 42

Load tmp/bombe_tna_full.ndjson, take 500 records balanced by archive, label field is archive
Embed text into 128 dimensions
Cluster using TCD recursive loop, 16 rounds, max 24 modules, energy = corpus mean
Align modules using 50 nearest records, fine label field is primary_category
Find dispersion of each label
Save to data/validation/tna_dsl_run.json
